1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,460
=Episode 12=

5
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:57,400
The Zhang lady.

6
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,879
You truly are no ordinary woman.

7
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,344
Who told you about me?

8
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:03,180
The Deputy
Military Commissioner of Liangzhou.

9
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,360
My family lived in Liangzhou.

10
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:12,599
I must've been seven years old.

11
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,120
One day,

12
00:02:15,648 --> 00:02:17,360
my father, my brothers,
and I saw from afar

13
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,439
the General ascend
the Liangzhou city walls.

14
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,800
Clad in armor,

15
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,039
you looked like a god.

16
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,759
Back then, you guarded the Northwest

17
00:02:35,296 --> 00:02:37,400
and protected
the twelve guards and four battalions.

18
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:41,680
To the people of Gansu, you were a god.

19
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,000
The 300,000 taels of gold...

20
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,599
Where is it hidden?

21
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,639
Zhang Luyao!

22
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:17,520
Move aside.

23
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,680
You can't enter the hall.

24
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:22,400
Is that the Commander-in-Chief's order

25
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,280
or General Ha's?

26
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:25,680
It makes no difference.

27
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,960
Trespassers

28
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:27,919
will be executed.

29
00:03:29,152 --> 00:03:30,590
Zhang Luyao went inside?

30
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,120
Yes.

31
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:38,120
Move aside!

32
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:39,639
Stand back.

33
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:40,759
Get out of my way!

34
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,680
Within Gansu,

35
00:03:43,792 --> 00:03:45,240
the General's orders are absolute.

36
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:48,479
God or ghost, anyone
who defies them will be killed.

37
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:51,150
Vice General Li
may not dare defy his orders,

38
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:53,400
but I'm not under his command.

39
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:56,120
You'll kill even a god?
Then try killing me!

40
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:07,000
The General is a god.

41
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,520
That's what my father used to say.

42
00:04:11,759 --> 00:04:13,240
My father, Zhang Baoshi,

43
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:16,600
rarely spoke to me.

44
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,399
Because I was a daughter.

45
00:04:20,768 --> 00:04:23,264
A daughter would eventually
marry and leave the family.

46
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,839
Once she left,

47
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,160
it was as if she'd never existed.

48
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,000
Where is the gold?

49
00:04:36,079 --> 00:04:37,839
Why are you in such a hurry, General?

50
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,879
Hear me out.

51
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,720
I'll get to the gold.

52
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,759
My father often told my brothers

53
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,199
to be like you,

54
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,600
brave, upright, and responsible.

55
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:57,560
And yet,

56
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,839
you ordered Tie Futu to poison them.

57
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,680
Everyone dies eventually.

58
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,800
That alone is nothing.

59
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:09,839
If the General
had simply given the order

60
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,950
and demanded the lives
of my father and brothers,

61
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:15,240
they would have braved any danger

62
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,800
without a word of complaint.

63
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:22,079
I'm a woman under Liangzhou's rule.

64
00:05:22,352 --> 00:05:23,510
I would have done the same.

65
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:26,399
Where exactly
are the 300,000 taels of gold?

66
00:05:30,439 --> 00:05:32,120
Let me ask you one more question.

67
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:35,079
If you answer me truthfully,

68
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:37,600
I'll tell you where the gold is.

69
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,439
What is it? Ask.

70
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,480
In this life,

71
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,199
is it better to die
with wealth beyond measure

72
00:05:49,279 --> 00:05:51,240
or to die with the respect of others?

73
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:54,399
People die for wealth,
just as birds die for food!

74
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,720
What do you believe in?

75
00:05:59,776 --> 00:06:01,168
Ha!
[*"Believe" and "surname" sound alike]

76
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:13,759
So your surname is Ha.

77
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:21,480
I asked what you believe in.

78
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,240
In this life,

79
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,000
some believe in kindness,

80
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,480
some believe in courage,

81
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,759
some believe in keeping their word,

82
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,639
and some believe in honesty.

83
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,399
What do you believe in?

84
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:43,079
I am General Pingxi,
Commander-in-Chief of Gansu.

85
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:46,160
Where are the 300,000 taels of gold?

86
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,759
So you don't dare believe in anything.

87
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:55,560
That makes things much simpler.

88
00:06:57,639 --> 00:07:00,199
If the Commander-in-Chief is the one
killing people for plunder,

89
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,639
a woman like me

90
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,480
wouldn't know what to do.

91
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:08,439
I am the Commander-in-Chief.

92
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:11,040
Where is the gold?

93
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,639
Here is my
Embroidered Uniform Guard token.

94
00:07:19,696 --> 00:07:22,240
A seventh-rank
Embroidered Uniform Guard officer

95
00:07:22,250 --> 00:07:23,800
has come to Gansu to investigate a case.

96
00:07:24,976 --> 00:07:26,310
Appointed by the imperial court,

97
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:28,850
a seventh-rank officer has
come to Gansu to investigate a case!

98
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:32,120
Guan Shanyue, Commander-in-Chief of
Gansu, abused the law for personal gain,

99
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,720
colluded with bandits,
killed, and plundered.

100
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,439
All twelve guards and four battalions

101
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:40,360
under Gansu's command.

102
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:43,040
Are you soldiers of the imperial court

103
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,319
or soldiers of Guan Shanyue?

104
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:57,199
All land under heaven
belongs to the King.

105
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,879
That sand

106
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:04,048
reeks of the bone-dissolving water from
Qiku Gorge in the Qinling Mountains.

107
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,920
I checked it
when you went to fetch water.

108
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,759
The bones have dissolved,

109
00:08:10,192 --> 00:08:12,040
but the lingering
deathly energy remains.

110
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,120
Your surname is Ha.

111
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,560
In the Northwest Great Desert,

112
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:28,079
who doesn't know
the Commander-in-Chief is Guan Shanyue?

113
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,080
You, surnamed Ha,

114
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:39,960
did you kill the General?

115
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,240
Where is the gold?

116
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,000
The General's guards will kill you.

117
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:54,080
The gold! Where is the gold?

118
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:01,039
Where is the gold?

119
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:02,399
Why should I tell you?

120
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,240
Are you planning to rebel?

121
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,000
Every one of you,

122
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,440
who dares rebel?

123
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:19,200
Do you?

124
00:10:20,279 --> 00:10:21,320
Or do you?

125
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,200
Or you?

126
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:50,159
Open the door.

127
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:01,879
Move aside.

128
00:11:02,879 --> 00:11:04,000
I'm going in, too.

129
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,600
Vice General Li.

130
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,720
Move aside!

131
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,200
I'm going in, too!

132
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,584
Vice General Li, please don't
make things difficult for us.

133
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:13,480
Deputy Yu has arrived.

134
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,200
Swallow it.

135
00:13:53,759 --> 00:13:55,039
Where is Ha Bingzhong?

136
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:58,279
He went in to see the General.

137
00:13:58,519 --> 00:14:01,519
Even the warriors
won't let you in, Vice General Li?

138
00:14:01,519 --> 00:14:02,720
The General has given orders.

139
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:04,639
Trespassers will be executed.

140
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,360
The General is dead.

141
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,120
The General is dead!

142
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,320
How is that possible?

143
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:17,360
Deputy, don't speak such nonsense.

144
00:14:17,919 --> 00:14:18,919
Do you have a death wish?

145
00:14:22,159 --> 00:14:23,919
One of my men from the Liangzhou Guard

146
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,744
said the same thing as you,
Vice General Li.

147
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,799
Anyone who dares say the General is dead

148
00:14:28,432 --> 00:14:29,320
will be executed.

149
00:14:30,496 --> 00:14:33,360
An Embroidered Uniform Guard officer
just went in to see the General.

150
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,159
Move.

151
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:03,799
I, Yu Hou,

152
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,360
have failed the General.

153
00:15:08,799 --> 00:15:09,879
Ha Bingzhong

154
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,399
issued false military orders

155
00:15:13,104 --> 00:15:14,840
and ordered me to collude with bandits

156
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:17,759
and kill 27 members
of the Zhang family in Liangzhou.

157
00:15:20,272 --> 00:15:22,910
The day before yesterday,
I knew the General was already dead,

158
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,559
yet I still

159
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,480
let greed get the better of me.

160
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:33,840
Deputy Yu,

161
00:15:34,759 --> 00:15:36,039
what are you saying?

162
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,679
The General is dead.

163
00:15:50,759 --> 00:15:53,159
Ha Bingzhong killed the attendant
who knew the truth

164
00:15:54,799 --> 00:15:57,480
and buried the General
in the sand behind the residence.

165
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,480
For three months,

166
00:15:59,632 --> 00:16:01,270
he claimed he was delivering medicine,

167
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:03,159
but in truth,

168
00:16:03,328 --> 00:16:05,536
he was using poison
to dissolve the General's remains.

169
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,279
Nobody move.

170
00:16:23,399 --> 00:16:24,600
Let me in.

171
00:16:25,039 --> 00:16:26,600
I'll kill Ha Bingzhong,

172
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,799
or let him kill me.

173
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:30,519
Deputy.

174
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,759
Move aside.

175
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,399
Move aside!

176
00:16:41,759 --> 00:16:42,639
Deputy.

177
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,240
Liangzhou Guard,

178
00:16:55,399 --> 00:16:56,039
forward!

179
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:05,680
Coroner.

180
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,039
Don't move.

181
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:18,920
My friend,

182
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,279
save me

183
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,599
enough strength

184
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:26,279
to go in and kill Ha Bingzhong myself.

185
00:18:21,808 --> 00:18:22,680
Draw your swords.

186
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:23,640
Deputy!

187
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,759
You're the General's personal guards.

188
00:18:33,079 --> 00:18:34,599
You haven't seen him for three months.

189
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:37,319
Don't you miss the General?

190
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,359
I'll take you to see

191
00:18:41,759 --> 00:18:43,279
the General's remains.

192
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,160
Move aside.

193
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:46,880
Move!

194
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,400
Anyone who stands in my way dies!

195
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,000
Move aside!

196
00:18:56,319 --> 00:18:57,119
Open the door.

197
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:59,280
Let the Deputy
Military Commissioner of Liangzhou in.

198
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,799
General.

199
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:41,880
- General!
- General!

200
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:45,519
- General!
- General!

201
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,119
Zhang Luyao.

202
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:03,880
Zhang Luyao.

203
00:20:12,559 --> 00:20:13,319
Zhang Luyao!

204
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:15,279
Zhang Luyao!

205
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:18,680
Zhang Luyao, it's me!

206
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:35,720
General.

207
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:19,039
Protect the General!

208
00:21:58,680 --> 00:21:59,920
He's not the General!

209
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:11,759
The General is dead!

210
00:22:20,559 --> 00:22:21,640
Ha Bingzhong!

211
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,920
Prepare to die!

212
00:22:56,279 --> 00:22:57,240
Zhang Luyao, it's me!

213
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:58,279
I'm Pu Ying!

214
00:23:17,359 --> 00:23:18,480
I don't want to kill you,

215
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,960
and I don't want to die
at anyone else's hands.

216
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,359
Aren't you immune to all poisons?

217
00:23:28,656 --> 00:23:30,680
Kill me, and you won't
have to suffer anymore.

218
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,440
Kill me!

219
00:23:35,519 --> 00:23:36,839
Kill me!

220
00:23:41,599 --> 00:23:42,400
Kill me.

221
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:44,759
Zhang Luyao.

222
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:50,720
Zhang Luyao!

223
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,599
Zhang Luyao.

224
00:24:01,359 --> 00:24:02,480
It hurts!

225
00:24:49,599 --> 00:24:50,279
Deputy!

226
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,079
General!

227
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,799
This isn't the General!

228
00:25:57,359 --> 00:25:58,559
Ha Bingzhong

229
00:25:59,119 --> 00:26:00,599
has brought chaos to Gansu.

230
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:04,839
You killed the wrong man!

231
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:35,319
Zhang Luyao!

232
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:38,559
I'm Pu Ying!

233
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,440
Let go.

234
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,119
Let go!

235
00:28:31,799 --> 00:28:33,480
You want to see the General?

236
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:35,240
I'll take you

237
00:28:35,559 --> 00:28:36,960
to see him.

238
00:28:38,119 --> 00:28:39,119
This way,

239
00:28:39,480 --> 00:28:41,079
the General is still here.

240
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,079
Deputy.

241
00:30:19,519 --> 00:30:20,640
Deputy Yu.

242
00:30:59,799 --> 00:31:01,039
Zhang Luyao.

243
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:03,839
It's me.

244
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:06,839
Yu Hou.

245
00:31:11,720 --> 00:31:13,119
This is where we part.

246
00:31:35,839 --> 00:31:36,680
Zhang Luyao.

247
00:32:26,079 --> 00:32:26,799
Officer.

248
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:34,200
Where's Ha Bingzhong?

249
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:36,319
Dead.

250
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,519
Don't touch her!

251
00:32:45,799 --> 00:32:47,039
Officer said not to touch her.

252
00:32:56,160 --> 00:32:56,880
Coroner.

253
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:01,720
Go check on her.

254
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,079
Is she still alive?

255
00:33:34,039 --> 00:33:34,880
Don't move.

256
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,279
Deputy.

257
00:33:47,440 --> 00:33:48,960
I know where she wants to go.

258
00:33:52,368 --> 00:33:54,960
I'll return to the Capital and report
on what happened in Gansu.

259
00:33:58,839 --> 00:33:59,680
Officer,

260
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:01,640
what are your orders?

261
00:34:04,119 --> 00:34:05,240
Prepare a carriage.

262
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:07,720
Yes.

263
00:34:40,599 --> 00:34:41,960
On this journey west,

264
00:34:42,599 --> 00:34:43,920
whether I live or die,

265
00:34:44,519 --> 00:34:46,159
I will never return.

266
00:34:47,600 --> 00:34:49,670
Everyone at
the Zhang Escort Agency is dead.

267
00:34:50,416 --> 00:34:52,320
You are responsible
for the people of Liangzhou.

268
00:34:52,688 --> 00:34:54,590
I'll leave
the agency's property deed to you.

269
00:34:55,079 --> 00:34:57,039
For military or civilian use,

270
00:34:58,119 --> 00:34:59,400
do with it as you see fit.

271
00:35:07,504 --> 00:35:09,190
You won't return even if you survive?

272
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,719
Do you have family in Gansu, Deputy?

273
00:35:16,640 --> 00:35:19,216
The Commander-in-Chief
was like a father and brother to me.

274
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:25,679
Were you the one
who poisoned the 27 members

275
00:35:27,119 --> 00:35:28,199
of my family?

276
00:35:34,199 --> 00:35:34,880
No.

277
00:35:41,199 --> 00:35:42,119
I believe you.

278
00:35:50,448 --> 00:35:52,280
I'll leave the silver bell
with you, too.

279
00:35:57,152 --> 00:35:59,510
Officer Pu was poisoned
by the feed for less than an hour.

280
00:35:59,519 --> 00:36:00,719
His frenzy gradually subsided.

281
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:03,590
The ancient Western Sichuan bell
can calm the mind.

282
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:07,079
It can help those overcome
by panic and frenzy

283
00:36:07,296 --> 00:36:09,296
calm down until their strength is spent.

284
00:36:20,208 --> 00:36:21,670
Why give it to me?

285
00:36:22,639 --> 00:36:24,559
Your heart is full of turmoil, Deputy.

286
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:28,400
Don't you need it?

287
00:36:32,039 --> 00:36:33,679
My heart is perfectly calm.

288
00:36:35,719 --> 00:36:36,760
Deep down,

289
00:36:37,599 --> 00:36:38,800
I've had many dark thoughts,

290
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:44,599
but I've never dared act on them.

291
00:36:47,440 --> 00:36:48,840
Being tired of the great desert

292
00:36:49,719 --> 00:36:51,039
and wanting to go south

293
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:52,920
isn't a dark thought.

294
00:36:57,159 --> 00:36:58,840
I've never met anyone like you.

295
00:37:11,079 --> 00:37:13,159
After daybreak,
we'll go our separate ways.

296
00:37:14,559 --> 00:37:16,239
We'll never meet again in this life.

297
00:37:17,639 --> 00:37:18,800
That's all?

298
00:37:19,639 --> 00:37:20,880
You're a good man.

299
00:37:22,159 --> 00:37:24,000
Good people should live a little longer.

300
00:37:29,088 --> 00:37:30,880
I never thought it would end like this.

301
00:37:33,239 --> 00:37:34,320
I'm going to sleep.

302
00:37:36,679 --> 00:37:38,719
Have a safe journey
at daybreak, Officer.

303
00:37:53,199 --> 00:37:54,599
We'll bury this lady here?

304
00:37:57,320 --> 00:37:58,440
That's all we can do.

305
00:38:00,864 --> 00:38:02,656
You'll be buried here too when you die?

306
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:05,440
When I die,

307
00:38:07,639 --> 00:38:09,320
I want to be buried at Wusu Sea.

308
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,280
Bancha said

309
00:38:15,199 --> 00:38:17,719
there's no better place
in the world than Wusu Sea.

310
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:20,840
How good is it?

311
00:38:23,719 --> 00:38:24,920
It's like heaven.

312
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:37,360
Yan.

313
00:38:37,800 --> 00:38:39,440
Go back to Mount Pingfeng.

314
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:42,159
Who's that man on horseback?

315
00:38:45,199 --> 00:38:47,880
Zhang Luyao hasn't come out
of the carriage for two days.

316
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:50,440
Even someone alive would be dead by now.

317
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:53,079
If she's dead, why not bury her?

318
00:38:53,679 --> 00:38:55,599
Where are they
taking her in that carriage?

319
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:59,480
Wusu Sea lies to the north.

320
00:39:00,039 --> 00:39:01,880
Do you think the gold might be there?

321
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:05,519
How much gold can one carriage carry?

322
00:39:08,239 --> 00:39:10,960
Zhang Luyao is dead.

323
00:39:12,039 --> 00:39:13,199
Does that upset you?

324
00:39:18,159 --> 00:39:19,360
Yan, I was wrong.

325
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:20,960
Back in Ganzhou,

326
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:23,400
I shouldn't have said
I couldn't let her go.

327
00:39:23,599 --> 00:39:26,239
You didn't say that. I asked you.

328
00:39:29,559 --> 00:39:30,719
Yan.

329
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:35,039
I was wrong.

330
00:39:37,536 --> 00:39:39,000
If you keep looking at me like that,

331
00:39:39,599 --> 00:39:40,880
I'm going to get angry.

332
00:39:59,079 --> 00:39:59,920
Bancha.

333
00:39:59,920 --> 00:40:01,360
Are we at Wusu Sea yet?

334
00:40:01,696 --> 00:40:03,630
If we're there,
why are the horses still moving?

335
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,639
Then I need to pee.

336
00:40:09,480 --> 00:40:11,199
Why are you still calling me Bancha?

337
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:13,519
Because you're Bancha.

338
00:40:13,519 --> 00:40:15,079
I need to get off the horse and pee.

339
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:17,079
What a nuisance.

340
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:21,280
Hold it.

341
00:40:23,159 --> 00:40:24,119
I can't.

342
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:26,000
I said hold it.

343
00:40:26,519 --> 00:40:27,280
Shut up.

344
00:41:47,639 --> 00:41:48,719
Stay away from the water.

345
00:41:50,239 --> 00:41:51,320
I'm going to pee.

346
00:41:52,159 --> 00:41:54,119
That's why you need
to stay away from the water.

347
00:41:54,679 --> 00:41:55,280
Go.

348
00:41:56,639 --> 00:41:57,800
The farther away, the better.

349
00:42:47,960 --> 00:42:48,960
The water isn't deep.

350
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:50,320
You can cross.

351
00:42:59,280 --> 00:43:00,840
I said you can cross.

352
00:43:02,360 --> 00:43:04,119
They can't speak.

353
00:43:07,280 --> 00:43:08,880
My name is Tang Zheng.

354
00:43:10,700 --> 00:43:13,260
(Preview of the Next Episode)

355
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:15,710
Zhang Luyao wanted
to be buried at Wusu Sea.

356
00:43:16,159 --> 00:43:17,559
So you're waiting here for her.

357
00:43:17,648 --> 00:43:19,376
You're taking her back to the Tang Clan?

358
00:43:19,679 --> 00:43:21,199
Cremate her.

359
00:43:21,639 --> 00:43:22,920
Eat slowly.

360
00:43:23,199 --> 00:43:25,039
She's a human being, too!

361
00:43:38,640 --> 00:43:43,640
=Remnants of Gold=
